{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537218, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42189, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788091519, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537218, "buffs": {"131": [[1083362, 131, 64312853, 150058, 1787910267, 1788169467, 11, 0]]}}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 879903913, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 59, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 13:54", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879903673,47288722,1694]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62600749]言秋洛[/uid] (2026-08-28 13:52):[/b]<br/><br/>看来是都没什么仓位了，已经开始笑谈跳水了[/quote]<br/>说了今天没风险  跳不了<br/>只是不买而已。<br/><br/>我能看懂的时候都是很肯定的  比如昨天说不能空仓 必须要有仓位  今天说没风险 <br/>看懂我就很直接的说。", "lou": 600, "content_length": 127, "reply_to": 879903673, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787896494}, {"pid": 879904721, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 69, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879904624,47288722,1695]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143133]keungy[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:01):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，请问下您这波铁盒杀跌完之后，您还会做铁盒吗？还是说只做您之前说的半导体材料，aidc液冷这些了？[/quote]<br/>等下一次有机会的时候吧 <br/>反正最简单的时间段已经过去了。", "lou": 601, "content_length": 57, "reply_to": 879904624, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787896952}, {"pid": 879904914, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 53, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879904798,47288722,1696]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=40830380]紫幻→星辰[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:03):[/b]<br/><br/>今天还会有一个神奇两点半吗[/quote]<br/>大概率没有 甚至可能反向。<br/>我猜的", "lou": 602, "content_length": 35, "reply_to": 879904798, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787897068}, {"pid": 879905093, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 58, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879904956,47288722,1696]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60563202]冲田beem[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:04):[/b]<br/><br/>我今天港股败绿-5抄的一手现在都感觉肉疼[s:ac:喷]杀的确实狠[/quote]<br/>我听说你们很多人昨天前天冲了胜宏  能不能和我说说为啥去送人头？ 是有什么特殊事件吗<br/>下午太无聊了  听点八卦", "lou": 603, "content_length": 103, "reply_to": 879904956, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787897156}, {"pid": 879905875, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879905580,47288722,1698]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60916468]灰兔尾[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:10):[/b]<br/><br/>你吃过螺狮粉吗？[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>那肯定啊 广西人一天四餐都是吃粉的。", "lou": 604, "content_length": 39, "reply_to": 879905580, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787897583}, {"pid": 879906217, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 37, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:16", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879906004,47288722,1699]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62198528]五鬼杀劫[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:14):[/b]<br/><br/>他是在以一个广西以外地区人聊螺蛳粉的角度解释为什么买胜宏[/quote]<br/>噢  理解了", "lou": 605, "content_length": 13, "reply_to": 879906004, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787897776}, {"pid": 879906802, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879906550,47288722,1700]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67087103]-咬我[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:19):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大炒螺蛳粉是正宗吗，我每次去南宁都狂炫那个[s:ac:茶][/quote]<br/>好吃就行 你管他是不是正宗<br/>没有一家粉摊的味道是一样的。除了那些连锁店", "lou": 606, "content_length": 71, "reply_to": 879906550, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787898087}, {"pid": 879907552, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 45, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879907383,47288722,1702]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67249786]冰的沸点sky123[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:26):[/b]<br/><br/>医药那边是真的精彩。。。。[/quote]<br/>药那边你就当老美那个抗癌药 是我们涛定律那一拨<br/>现在就是套定律之后那一拨的博弈，你看看是不是差不多", "lou": 607, "content_length": 99, "reply_to": 879907383, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787898483}, {"pid": 879907798, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 38, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879907626,47288722,1702]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=18721885]喜盐不喜甜[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:28):[/b]<br/><br/>这是游资出给量化的环节了吗，散户最喜欢这种地天的激情了，他们可以在最狂热的发货[/quote]<br/>而且这波更凶险  因为里面没有一个对基本面有信仰的  纯筹码博弈的话波动会更剧烈  <br/>也就是可能个别大哥能稍微好一点 。", "lou": 608, "content_length": 109, "reply_to": 879907626, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787898622}, {"pid": 879907946, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 34, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:31", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879907692,47288722,1702]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66707475]股票大韭菜回忆录[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:29):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大吃得惯鱼生吗，鱼生对于广西人来讲算是普通餐食吗(就是像麻婆豆腐之于四川银)[/quote]<br/>也还好  淡水鱼生还是少吃一点  一年吃两三次横县鱼生还是没问题的 。多拌点油就行了。", "lou": 609, "content_length": 81, "reply_to": 879907692, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787898709}, {"pid": 879908537, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 34, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:37", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879908130,47288722,1703]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62058466]oldcat997[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:33):[/b]<br/><br/>淡水鱼不怎么生吃吧，很容易感染寄生虫啊[/quote]<br/>因为确实太好吃了 <br/>只是不敢多吃而已。<br/>但是广西人不怕", "lou": 610, "content_length": 53, "reply_to": 879908130, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899022}, {"pid": 879908749, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879908203,47288722,1703]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62771233]极地丶之光[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:34):[/b]<br/><br/>云南的干巴菌炒饭真是真的香，怎么会有这么香的菌[/quote]<br/>我觉得那个像干柴。。。我还是比较喜欢鸡枞和羊肚", "lou": 611, "content_length": 51, "reply_to": 879908203, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899124}, {"pid": 879908849, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 45, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:39", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879908281,47288722,1703]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=222457]格里非斯[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:35):[/b]<br/><br/>今天没风险，但是不能买。那意思就是今天买的明天没法挣钱出来，也就是说明天危险，可以这么理解……吧[/quote]<br/>没有差价啊<br/>买进去的目的是要吃涨幅<br/>你买进去不能涨你买来干啥  为了周末提心吊胆两天？", "lou": 612, "content_length": 83, "reply_to": 879908281, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899182}, {"pid": 879909051, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 30, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879908517,47288722,1704]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66863903]晓拉条[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:36):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大 想问一下药这边中军姚明也不能看了吗[/quote]<br/>我不去  不好判断<br/>我觉得我没能力做那一边。", "lou": 613, "content_length": 43, "reply_to": 879908517, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899285}, {"pid": 879909365, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 25, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:44", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879909147,47288722,1705]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=61700825]Swdrag0n[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:42):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，评价一下横县和顺德鱼生[/quote]<br/>配料不同   各有各的风味<br/>我更喜欢横县的   <br/>顺德那边是吃烧鹅的时候顺便吃点。", "lou": 614, "content_length": 71, "reply_to": 879909147, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899443}, {"pid": 879909495, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 69, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:45", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们看这个尾盘<br/>我刚才说什么来着<br/>提前给你们说的明明白白的[s:ac:哭笑] <br/>包括早上和下午的判断。", "lou": 615, "content_length": 74, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899512}, {"pid": 879909624, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879909466,47288722,1705]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66685202]Chan0607[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:44):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，那潮州鱼生呢[/quote]<br/>那边生腌还不错  其他一般。最主要是我确实听不懂潮州话 很少过去。", "lou": 616, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 879909466, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899580}, {"pid": 879910043, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 72, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:49", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879909864,47288722,1706]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62740939]一口糖汽水[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:48):[/b]<br/><br/>去山上摘菌子都比炒股好玩。更别提运气好可能一天下来挣得比炒股还多[s:ac:哭笑]就等什么时候省里发通知，就再去摘了[/quote]<br/>这个我知道  上次去朋友那玩 他说  出通知说不要上山挖蘑菇 警惕食物中毒  这个就是信号了 <br/>然后带我上山挖了一堆[s:ac:偷笑]", "lou": 617, "content_length": 99, "reply_to": 879909864, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787899789}, {"pid": 879917463, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 69, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 15:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879914815,47288722,1712]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=61733758]不谈主义只谈理想[/uid] (2026-08-28 15:30):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大 我真的诚心的问一下昨天为什么不能进胜宏呢？如果昨天进PCB板块其他个股今天都有冲高走的机会，唯独这个胜宏直接深水开[/quote]<br/>。。。容量大票 在主升行情都没见得走得很好<br/>现在这种缩量行情你指望他业绩能带来啥，光大哥二哥没有示范吗<br/>重点是现在是缩量啊。", "lou": 618, "content_length": 123, "reply_to": 879914815, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787903598}, {"pid": 879987929, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 114, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-29 11:32", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们看吧，周五你买进去除了多担心几天外还有啥好处？<br/>不能挣钱的动作就别做，你们最要命的问题就是必须操作，不操作不舒服", "lou": 619, "content_length": 114, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787974364}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283264, "replies": 35763, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788164891, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "风涧竹月", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788164922, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788161278, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "f